  "title": "Easy Ground Beef Stroganoff",
  "description": "This ground beef stroganoff recipe is quick and easy to make with mushrooms and sour cream in 30 minutes; serve over noodles for a family favorite.",
  "authors": [
    "Linda Russell"
  ],
